              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಎಲ್ಲರ ಮುಂದೆ ಹಾಡುವಾಗ ನನಗೆ ಮುಜುಗರ ಆಯಿತು. ellara munde hāḍuvāga nanage mujugara āyitu. Singing in front of everyone, I felt embarrassed."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Sharper than ನಾಚಿಕೆ: the discomfort of an awkward moment, often caused by someone else."
            }
