              "text": "ಕಳವಳ — kaḷavaḷa — \"unease; agitation\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ರಾತ್ರಿ ಮಗ ಬರಲಿಲ್ಲ, ಅಮ್ಮನಿಗೆ ಕಳವಳ ಆಯಿತು. rātri maga baralilla, ammanige kaḷavaḷa āyitu. The son had not come by night; his mother grew uneasy."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A restless worry that will not settle; ಕಳವಳಗೊಳ್ಳು, to grow uneasy."
            }
          ]
        },
