              "text": "ಕಳವಳ (kaḷavaḷa) is native Dravidian: DEDR 1306 lists Kannada kaḷakaḷa and kaḷavaḷike, \"agitation of the mind, distress\", and the verb kaḷavaḷisu, \"to be agitated\"."
            }
